<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN NATIONAL BANK PLANNING WORLD WIDE WEB SITE.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN NATIONAL BANK PLANNING WORLD WIDE WEB SITE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank (BNB) is developing a world wide web site for the Internet, a spokesman for the central bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;In the near future it is possible that we will also have a website. A proposal to this effect has been made to the board,&quot; he told Reuters. He declined to speculate when the website would be operational.</p>
<p>The spokesman had been asked if the central bank would follow the lead of the Bank for International Settlements (http://www.bis.org) and other European central banks in developing a home page.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
